  "description": "Provider-neutral contracts and shared models for Mythosia.AI. Defines IAIService, the optional IImageGenerationService capability, messages, streaming content, image request/results, model identifiers, ordered function-call/result batches, and sequential or bounded-parallel execution policy. Depends only on the lightweight Mythosia base package and no provider SDKs.",
